Find the department names of all instructors...
SELECT dept_name FROM instructor;

Since more than one instructor can belong to a department, a department name could appear more than once in the instructor relation. So if we want to elimanate duplicates then use...
SELECT DISTINCT dept_name FROM instructor;

TO specify explicitly that duplicates are not removed, use...
SELECT ALL dept_name FROM instructor;

SELECT * FROM instructor, department;
Gives the result of Cartesian product and the attribute names will be
<id, name, dept_name, salary, dept_name, building,
